### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

###
### 1. Admin login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin123

### 2. Teacher create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/teachers
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"t1","password":"pass123","fullName":"Dr. Rahman","email":"t1@uni.edu","department":"CSE"}

### 3. Student create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"s1","password":"pass123","fullName":"Karim","email":"s1@uni.edu","studentId":"2107001"}

### 4. List teachers
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers

### 5. Logout
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/logout

### 6. Teacher login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=t1&password=pass123

### 7. Teacher nijer record (id = 2) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers/2

